+// Copyright (C) 2007 Carlos Garcia Campos <carlosgc@gnome.org>
+// Copyright (C) 2010 Ilya Gorenbein <igorenbein@finjan.com>
+// Copyright (C) 2010 Hib Eris <hib@hiberis.nl>
